---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Coffee Subscription | Etude de cas">
  <section class="container case-hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Coffee Subscription</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        &Eacute;tude de cas &mdash; SAP ABAP RAP (Managed, Draft, OData V4, Fiori Elements)
      </p>
      <div class="badge-list">
        <span class="badge">RAP</span>
        <span class="badge">CDS</span>
        <span class="badge">BDEF</span>
        <span class="badge">Draft</span>
        <span class="badge">Validations</span>
        <span class="badge">Determinations</span>
        <span class="badge">OData V4</span>
        <span class="badge">ADT</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container case-shell">
    <aside class="case-sidebar">
      <div class="card case-nav">
        <div class="card-title">Navigation rapide</div>
        <nav>
          <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
          <a href="#artefacts">Artefacts ADT</a>
          <a href="#chronologie">Chronologie</a>
          <a href="#regles">R&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier</a>
          <a href="#draft">Draft &amp; erreurs</a>
          <a href="#vh">Value Helps</a>
          <a href="#debug">Debug &amp; difficult&eacute;s</a>
          <a href="#conclusion">Conclusion</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="case-main">
      <details class="case-nav-mobile">
        <summary>Navigation rapide</summary>
        <nav>
          <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
          <a href="#artefacts">Artefacts ADT</a>
          <a href="#chronologie">Chronologie</a>
          <a href="#regles">R&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier</a>
          <a href="#draft">Draft &amp; erreurs</a>
          <a href="#vh">Value Helps</a>
          <a href="#debug">Debug &amp; difficult&eacute;s</a>
          <a href="#conclusion">Conclusion</a>
        </nav>
      </details>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="card case-summary">
          <h2>Contexte m&eacute;tier &amp; &eacute;tude de cas</h2>
          <p class="muted">
            Ce projet s&rsquo;inscrit dans ma mont&eacute;e en comp&eacute;tence sur RAP, men&eacute;e en parall&egrave;le de
            mes missions. L&rsquo;objectif est de simuler un cas proche de la production, avec une
            architecture robuste, des r&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier claires, une UI Fiori propre et un parcours
            de debug r&eacute;aliste. Le tout en respectant les bonnes pratiques SAP pour un delivery
            propre et maintenable.
          </p>
        </div>
        <details class="accordion-box">
          <summary>
            <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
                <path d="M12 8v8"></path>
                <path d="M8 12h8"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            Ce que d&eacute;montre ce projet
          </summary>
          <ul class="accordion-list">
            <li>Capacit&eacute; &agrave; concevoir un objet m&eacute;tier complet en RAP</li>
            <li>Compr&eacute;hension du lien m&eacute;tier &harr; technique</li>
            <li>Ma&icirc;trise des concepts cl&eacute;s (draft, validations, determinations)</li>
            <li>D&eacute;marche proche d&rsquo;un projet de production</li>
          </ul>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 6h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 18h10"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Cas m&eacute;tier simul&eacute; &mdash; Coffee Subscription</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="muted">
            L&rsquo;application <strong>Coffee Subscription</strong> simule un cas m&eacute;tier
            r&eacute;aliste de <strong>gestion d&rsquo;abonnements</strong>, inspir&eacute; de
            sc&eacute;narios fr&eacute;quemment rencontr&eacute;s en production (abonnements clients,
            contrats r&eacute;currents, services &agrave; fr&eacute;quence d&eacute;finie).
          </p>
          <p class="muted">
            Le principe est volontairement simple et repr&eacute;sentatif : un client peut
            souscrire &agrave; un abonnement de caf&eacute; en choisissant <strong>un type de
            caf&eacute;</strong>, <strong>une fr&eacute;quence de livraison</strong> et
            <strong>un statut de souscription</strong>. Ces informations sont ensuite g&eacute;r&eacute;es
            tout au long du <strong>cycle de vie de l&rsquo;abonnement</strong> : cr&eacute;ation,
            modification, validation et activation.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">D&rsquo;un point de vue m&eacute;tier, ce cas est directement comparable &agrave; :</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>des <strong>abonnements de services</strong> (SaaS, maintenance, contrats r&eacute;currents),</li>
            <li>des <strong>contrats clients</strong> avec r&egrave;gles de gestion sp&eacute;cifiques,</li>
            <li>ou plus largement &agrave; des <strong>objets m&eacute;tiers critiques</strong> n&eacute;cessitant un pilotage fin de leur cycle de vie.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="muted">Ce projet m&rsquo;a permis de reproduire des probl&eacute;matiques proches de la production, notamment :</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>le <strong>contr&ocirc;le des donn&eacute;es</strong> &agrave; la cr&eacute;ation et &agrave; la modification,</li>
            <li>la <strong>gestion des &eacute;tats</strong> via le mode <em>draft</em>,</li>
            <li>des <strong>validations m&eacute;tier bloquantes</strong>,</li>
            <li>des <strong>d&eacute;terminations automatiques</strong>,</li>
            <li>et l&rsquo;exposition d&rsquo;une <strong>UI Fiori coh&eacute;rente et guid&eacute;e</strong> pour l&rsquo;utilisateur final.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="muted">
            L&rsquo;objectif n&rsquo;&eacute;tait pas de r&eacute;aliser une simple application &ldquo;d&eacute;mo&rdquo;,
            mais bien de <strong>concevoir une architecture propre, extensible et maintenable</strong>,
            align&eacute;e avec les <strong>bonnes pratiques SAP RAP</strong>, dans une logique proche
            d&rsquo;un <strong>contexte projet r&eacute;el</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="architecture" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 4h6v6H4z"></path>
              <path d="M14 4h6v6h-6z"></path>
              <path d="M4 14h6v6H4z"></path>
              <path d="M14 14h6v6h-6z"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Architecture</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder">Sch&eacute;ma d&rsquo;architecture &agrave; ajouter</div>
        <p class="muted">
          Tables &rarr; CDS Interface &rarr; CDS Projection &rarr; BDEF &rarr; Service &rarr; OData V4 &rarr;
          Fiori Elements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="artefacts" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M7 8h10M7 12h10M7 16h6"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Artefacts ADT</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card table-card">
          <div class="table">
            <div class="table-row table-header">
              <span>Type</span>
              <span>Exemple</span>
              <span>R&ocirc;le</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Tables</span>
              <span>ZCS_SUB_TRL, ZCS_SUB_TRL_D</span>
              <span>Persistence + draft</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>CDS Interface</span>
              <span>ZI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</span>
              <span>Mod&egrave;le m&eacute;tier</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>CDS Projection</span>
              <span>ZC_COFFEE_SUB_TRL, ZC_*_VH</span>
              <span>Exposition UI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Behavior</span>
              <span>ZBP_I_COFFEE_SUB_TRL</span>
              <span>R&egrave;gles et draft</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-row">
              <span>Service</span>
              <span>ZUI_COFFEE_SUB_TRL + Binding O4</span>
              <span>OData V4</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="chronologie" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
              <path d="M12 7v6l3 3"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Chronologie</h2>
        </div>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">1. Tables</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : structurer la persistence et le draft.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture ADT &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <p class="muted">Mise en place des tables ZCS_SUB_TRL et ZCS_SUB_TRL_D.</p>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : base data fiable.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">2. CDS</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : mod&eacute;liser ZI et projections ZC.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture ADT &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <p class="muted">ZI pour la logique m&eacute;tier, ZC pour l&rsquo;exposition UI.</p>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : s&eacute;paration mod&egrave;le / UI.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">3. Service Binding</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : exposer l&rsquo;API OData V4.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture ADT &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <p class="muted">Service Definition + Binding O4 pour Fiori Elements.</p>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : exposition stable.</div>
        </article>

        <article id="draft" class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">4. Draft</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : permettre l&rsquo;&eacute;dition en brouillon.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Draft configuration)</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir explication</summary>
            <div class="muted">
              Activation du draft dans le BDEF et gestion du verrouillage pour un sc&eacute;nario multi-utilisateurs.
            </div>
          </details>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : exp&eacute;rience utilisateur.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">5. Validations</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : contr&ocirc;les m&eacute;tier &agrave; la sauvegarde.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Validation quantity)</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir explication</summary>
            <div class="muted">R&egrave;gles de coh&eacute;rence appliqu&eacute;es avant activation.</div>
          </details>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">6. Determinations</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : automatiser les r&egrave;gles.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture ADT &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Determination next delivery)</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir explication</summary>
            <div class="muted">Calcul des champs d&eacute;riv&eacute;s et coh&eacute;rence des statuts.</div>
          </details>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : coh&eacute;rence m&eacute;tier.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">7. Actions</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : d&eacute;clencher des actions cibl&eacute;es.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Action activation)</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir explication</summary>
            <div class="muted">Actions custom pour activer ou mettre &agrave; jour l&rsquo;abonnement.</div>
          </details>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : agilit&eacute; fonctionnelle.</div>
        </article>

        <article id="vh" class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">8. Value Helps</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : simplifier la saisie.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Value Help)</pre>
          </details>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir explication</summary>
            <div class="muted">Vues ZC_*_VH pour fiabiliser les entr&eacute;es.</div>
          </details>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : ergonomie Fiori.</div>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-header">9. Error handling</div>
          <p class="muted">Objectif : g&eacute;rer les erreurs proprement.</p>
          <div class="step-image image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
          <details class="code-toggle">
            <summary>Voir snippet</summary>
            <pre class="code-block">// TODO: snippet RAP (Error handling)</pre>
          </details>
          <p class="muted">Messages clairs, erreurs bloquantes et reprise via draft.</p>
          <div class="step-takeaway">Ce que cette &eacute;tape d&eacute;montre : robustesse de l&rsquo;app.</div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="regles" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 6h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M4 18h10"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>R&egrave;gles m&eacute;tier</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="muted">
            R&egrave;gles de validation &agrave; la sauvegarde, d&eacute;terminations automatiques et
            coh&eacute;rence des statuts pour simuler un contexte proche de la production.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M8 6h8"></path>
              <path d="M8 18h8"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Cycle RAP (du point de vue utilisateur)</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card flow-card">
          <div class="flow-steps">
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
                  <path d="M8 12h8"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>Creer un abonnement &rarr; Draft cr&eacute;&eacute;</span>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
                  <path d="M12 4v16"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>Choix type/frequence &rarr; Value Helps</span>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M4 4h16v6H4z"></path>
                  <path d="M4 14h16v6H4z"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>Determinations auto (ex: prochaine livraison)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M5 12l4 4L19 6"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>Validations (quantit&eacute; &gt; 0, frequence non initiale)</span>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M4 7h16"></path>
                  <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
                  <path d="M4 17h10"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>Erreur : message affich&eacute;, draft conserv&eacute;</span>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
                  <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span>OK : Enregistrer/Activer &rarr; instance active, draft supprim&eacute;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="muted flow-example">
            Exemple : Type Arabica, Fr&eacute;quence mensuelle, Quantit&eacute; 3. La prochaine livraison est
            pr&eacute;-calcul&eacute;e, les validations passent, l&rsquo;instance active est cr&eacute;&eacute;e.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="M8 18h8"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Aper&ccedil;u de l&rsquo;application</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="image-placeholder">Capture Fiori &agrave; ajouter</div>
      </section>

      <section id="debug" class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M4 12h16"></path>
              <path d="M9 4v16"></path>
              <path d="M15 4v16"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2>Debug &amp; difficult&eacute;s</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Probl&egrave;me</div>
            <p class="muted">M&eacute;tadonn&eacute;es bloquantes, l&rsquo;UI ne s&rsquo;ouvre pas.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Analyse</div>
            <p class="muted">Incoh&eacute;rence sur une annotation de criticality.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Nettoyage des annotations et re-test OData.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on</div>
            <p class="muted">Toujours valider les m&eacute;tadonn&eacute;es apr&egrave;s un changement.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Probl&egrave;me</div>
            <p class="muted">Draft non sauvegard&eacute; correctement.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Analyse</div>
            <p class="muted">Champ obligatoire manquant en persistence.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Alignement table et CDS.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on</div>
            <p class="muted">Tester les cas limites d&egrave;s le d&eacute;but.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card incident-card">
            <div class="card-title">Probl&egrave;me</div>
            <p class="muted">Erreurs sur d&eacute;terminations.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Analyse</div>
            <p class="muted">Type non conforme dans le handler.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Correction</div>
            <p class="muted">Correction signatures + logs cibl&eacute;s.</p>
            <div class="card-title">Le&ccedil;on</div>
            <p class="muted">Isoler les handlers critiques.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="conclusion" class="section">
        <div class="card cta-card">
          <div>
            <h2>Conclusion</h2>
            <p class="muted">
              Ce projet m&rsquo;a permis de consolider les bases RAP, de mieux structurer l&rsquo;architecture
              et d&rsquo;am&eacute;liorer ma capacit&eacute; &agrave; d&eacute;bugger. En V2, j&rsquo;ajouterai des
              optimisations de performance et davantage d&rsquo;automatisations UI. Prochain focus :
              un article sur mes 20% d&rsquo;ADT les plus utiles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="button ghost" href="/blog/adt-rap">Lire bient&ocirc;t</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
